rassing  deaths to happen in this show or almost  any show that i can think of just to get  gunned down on the crapper i mean that's  a shameful way to go but you know what  for a guy who was as powerful as he was  and as high and mighty as he was and how  much  strength he had to go out like that at  somehow it just felt right and it was  cathart i've used that word a few times  here but cathartic for tyrion to be the  one to take him out because tyrion had  taken so much of his crap not only over  the course of this show but you really  got the impact of over the course of his  whole  life he'd been trying to please this man  and taking his crap  no more and he said no more with a  crossbow bolt number three  oberyn martell undoubtedly the most  painful death that is on this list and i  it's it's this high up for that reason  alone it's not one that i necessarily  enjoyed because some of these deaths i  enjoyed on some level either it was a  character i wanted to see die or  something was cool about the death  itself but this one i did not have fun  with but it impacted me so heavily i  can't not put it way up high on the list  you know i've said it before and i will  say it again i do honestly think this is  the most brutal death that i have ever  seen  anywhere in any movie in any tv show in  comic books whatever this is so  painful and not just the the instant of  death itself but as soon as you realize  that this guy is going to turn the  tables and take out this character who  you love  the instant you realize that happens  like oh no no no no no no and then the  beating and like the thumbs and the head  oh man it's it's  brutal it is so brutal it's brutal on  the character is brutal on the audience  and it is an unforgettable death i mean  this one still haunts me  i  i haven't watched it a second time since  this aired it i don't know how i'm gonna  manage to do it but  man  even if i never watch it again i will  never forget it number two joffrey  baratheo